      "text": "🐄 Last July, An visited his grandparents' farm. It was far from the city, so he went there by train. He stayed for ten days."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Early in the morning, Grandpa woke An up at six o'clock. They fed the chickens and the ducks. An found five eggs under a chicken."
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Grandma was a very good cook. She made soup with vegetables from the garden. An thought it was the best soup in the world."
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "text": "🐴 In the afternoon, An rode Grandpa's old brown horse. Its name was Lucky. At first, An was afraid, but then he enjoyed it."
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "text": "One day, a baby cow was born. An helped Grandpa give it some milk. They called it Daisy."
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "text": "In the evening, they sat outside and looked at the stars. There were no city lights, so the stars were very bright. An did not want to go home."
    }
